(1495,N'PR-HR-01',N'Perform Personnel Background Screening',N'6.1',N'Screen All Personnel Prior to Engagement',N'Perform Complete the approved background-screening checks when Before issuing an employment or engagement confirmation, led by Human Resources, and complete it Before engagement. Frequency: Pre-employment. Evidence required: Background screening report: Completed screening report with approval and date.',N'all personnel, pre-employment, background screening, engagement',N'Report',N'Evidence: Background screening report. Details: Completed screening report with approval and date',N'Complete the approved background-screening checks',N'One-time',N'Before issuing an employment or engagement confirmation',N'Human Resources',N'Before engagement'),
(1496,N'PR-HR-01',N'Perform Personnel Background Screening',N'6.1',N'Verify Candidate References',N'Perform Contact and validate approved candidate references when After candidate selection and before engagement, led by Human Resources or authorized screening provider, and complete it Before engagement. Frequency: Pre-employment. Evidence required: Reference check record: Documented referee responses and verification outcome.',N'candidate references, referee validation, employment history',N'Record',N'Evidence: Reference check record. Details: Documented referee responses and verification outcome',N'Contact and validate approved candidate references',N'One-time',N'After candidate selection and before engagement',N'Human Resources or authorized screening provider',N'Before engagement'),
