(1498,N'PR-HR-01',N'Perform Personnel Background Screening',N'6.1',N'Verify Candidate Identity',N'Perform Validate the candidate identity using approved documents and checks when Before any employment or system-access approval, led by Human Resources, and complete it Before engagement. Frequency: Pre-employment. Evidence required: Identity verification record: Validated government-issued identity evidence and verification result.',N'identity proof, identity validation, candidate verification',N'Record',N'Evidence: Identity verification record. Details: Validated government-issued identity evidence and verification result',N'Validate the candidate identity using approved documents and checks',N'One-time',N'Before any employment or system-access approval',N'Human Resources',N'Before engagement'),
